          "evidence": "The supported System-to-Process-to-Thread form realizes seven boundary INTs with seven additional root/Process delegations and 28 direct internal flows: 7*2+28 gives exactly 42 raw PortConnection declarations while semantic interactions remain 35. The same containment/delegation form is accepted in the current factory-medium source, whose fresh current Sireum check exited 0 with Well-formed!.",
          "requested_change": ""
        },
        {
